<noinclude>{{Documentationpage}}</noinclude>
Nominates a page for deletion and adds it to [[:Category:Nominated for deletion]].

Based on {{tl|mbox}}.

==Usage==
<pre>{{delete|reason}}</pre>

===Parameters===
{{Docparam|name=&lt;unnamed 1<nowiki/>>|req=yes|default=|desc=
Reason why this page should be deleted
}}

{{Docparam|name=bot|req=no|default=|desc=
If set to "yes," the deletion request is specified as having been made by a [[Help:Bots|bot]]. Overrides <code>reason</code> and should only be used for automated revisions.
}}